{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.25+commit.b61c2a91"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"_eurc","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"constructor"},{"inputs":[],"name":"IL1OpEURCFactory_NoInitializeTx","type":"error"},{"anonymous":false,"inputs":[{"indexed":false,"internalType":"address","name":"_l1Adapter","type":"address"},{"indexed":false,"internalType":"address","name":"_l2Deploy","type":"address"},{"indexed":false,"internalType":"address","name":"_l2Adapter","type":"address"}],"name":"ProtocolDeployed","type":"event"},{"inputs":[],"name":"EURC","outputs":[{"internalType":"contract IEURC","name":"","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"},{"inputs":[],"name":"EURC_NAME","outputs":[{"internalType":"string","name":"","type":"string"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"},{"inputs":[],"name":"EURC_SYMBOL","outputs":[{"internalType":"string","name":"","type":"string"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"},{"inputs":[],"name":"L2_CREATE2_DEPLOYER","outputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"},{"inputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"_l1Messenger","type":"address"},{"internalType":"address","name":"_l1AdapterOwner","type":"address"},{"internalType":"string","name":"_chainName","type":"string"},{"components":[{"internalType":"address","name":"l2AdapterOwner","type":"address"},{"internalType":"address","name":"eurcImplAddr","type":"address"},{"internalType":"uint32","name":"minGasLimitDeploy","type":"uint32"},{"internalType":"bytes[]","name":"eurcInitTxs","type":"bytes[]"}],"internalType":"struct IL1OpEURCFactory.L2Deployments","name":"_l2Deployments","type":"tuple"}],"name":"deploy","outputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"_l1Adapter","type":"address"},{"internalType":"address","name":"_l2Deploy","type":"address"},{"internalType":"address","name":"_l2Adapter","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"function"},{"inputs":[],"name":"deploymentsSaltCounter","outputs":[{"internalType":"uint256","name":"","type":"uint256"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"}],"devdoc":{"details":"The salt is always different for each deployed instance of this contract on the L1 Factory, and the L2 contracts are deployed with `CREATE` to guarantee that the addresses are unique among all the L2s, so we avoid a scenario where L2 contracts have the same address on different L2s when triggered by different owners.","events":{"ProtocolDeployed(address,address,address)":{"params":{"_l1Adapter":"The address of the L1 adapter","_l2Adapter":"The address of the L2 adapter","_l2Deploy":"The address of the L2 deployer contract"}}},"kind":"dev","methods":{"constructor":{"params":{"_eurc":"The address of the EURC contract"}},"deploy(address,address,string,(address,address,uint32,bytes[]))":{"details":"It can fail on L2 due to a gas miscalculation, but in that case the tx can be replayed. It only deploys 1 L2 factory per L2 deployments, to make sure the nonce is being tracked correctly while precalculating addressesThe implementation of the EURC contract needs to be deployed on L2 before this is called Then set the `eurcImplAddr` in the L2Deployments struct to the address of the deployed EURC implementation contractIMPORTANT!!!! The _l2Deployments.eurcInitTxs must be manually entered to correctly initialize the EURC contract on L2. If a function is not included in the init txs, it could lead to potential attack vectors. We currently hardcode the `initialize()` function in the L2 factory contract, to correctly configure the setup You must provide the following init txs: - initalizeV2 - initilizeV2_1 - initializeV2_2 It is also important to note that circle may add more init functions in future implementations This is up to the deployer to check and be sure all init transactions are included","params":{"_chainName":"The name of the L2 Op chain","_l1AdapterOwner":"The address of the owner of the L1 adapter","_l1Messenger":"The address of the L1 messenger for the L2 Op chain","_l2Deployments":"The deployments data for the L2 adapter, and the L2 EURC contracts"},"returns":{"_l1Adapter":"The address of the L1 adapter","_l2Adapter":"The address of the L2 adapter","_l2Deploy":"The address of the L2 deployer contract"}}},"stateVariables":{"EURC":{"return":"The address of EURC on L1","returns":{"_0":"The address of EURC on L1"}},"EURC_NAME":{"details":"If the 3rd party team wants to update the name, it can be done on the `initialize2()` 2nd init tx","return":"The name of the EURC token","returns":{"_0":"The name of the EURC token"}},"EURC_SYMBOL":{"return":"The symbol of the EURC token","returns":{"_0":"The symbol of the EURC token"}},"L2_CREATE2_DEPLOYER":{"return":"The address of the `create2Deployer` contract on L2","returns":{"_0":"The address of the `create2Deployer` contract on L2"}},"_INITIALIZE_SELECTOR":{"details":"Used to check the first init tx doesn't match it since it is already defined in the L2 factory contract"},"deploymentsSaltCounter":{"return":"The counter for the deployments salt to be used on the L2 factory deployment","returns":{"_0":"The counter for the deployments salt to be used on the L2 factory deployment"}}},"title":"L1OpEURCFactory","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"IL1OpEURCFactory_NoInitializeTx()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the `initialize()` tx is provided as the first init tx for the EURC contract"}]},"events":{"ProtocolDeployed(address,address,address)":{"notice":"Emitted when the `L1OpEURCBridgeAdapter` is deployed"}},"kind":"user","methods":{"constructor":{"notice":"Constructs the L1 factory contract"},"deploy(address,address,string,(address,address,uint32,bytes[]))":{"notice":"Deploys the L1 Adapter, and sends the deployment txs for the L2 factory, L2 adapter and the L2 EURC through the L1 messenger"}},"notice":"Factory contract to deploy and setup the `L1OpEURCBridgeAdapter` contract on L1, and triggers the deployment of the L2 factory, L2 adapter, and L2 EURC contracts.","version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"src/contracts/L1OpEURCFactory.sol":"L1OpEURCFactory"},"evmVersion":"paris","libraries":{"src/libraries/CrossChainDeployments.sol:CrossChainDeployments":"0xd41585288c0585938641f84654f2e689adea31d0"},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[":@openzeppelin/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/",":contracts/=src/contracts/",":ds-test/=node_modules/ds-test/src/",":forge-std/=node_modules/forge-std/src/",":halmos-cheatcodes/=node_modules/halmos-cheatcodes/src/",":interfaces/=src/interfaces/",":libraries/=src/libraries/",":solhint/=node_modules/solhint/"],"viaIR":true},"sources":{"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/access/OwnableUpgradeable.sol":{"keccak256":"0xc163fcf9bb10138631a9ba5564df1fa25db9adff73bd9ee868a8ae1858fe093a","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://9706d43a0124053d9880f6e31a59f31bc0a6a3dc1acd66ce0a16e1111658c5f6","dweb:/ipfs/QmUFmfowzkRwGtDu36cXV9SPTBHJ3n7dG9xQiK5B28jTf2"]},"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/proxy/utils/Initializable.sol":{"keccak256":"0x631188737069917d2f909d29ce62c4d48611d326686ba6683e26b72a23bfac0b","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://7a61054ae84cd6c4d04c0c4450ba1d6de41e27e0a2c4f1bcdf58f796b401c609","dweb:/ipfs/QmUvtdp7X1mRVyC3CsHrtPbgoqWaXHp3S1ZR24tpAQYJWM"]},"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/proxy/utils/UUPSUpgradeable.sol":{"keccak256":"0x3f13b947637c4969c0644cab4ef399cdc4b67f101463b8775c5a43b118558e53","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://c6683e6ade6985d394d32baaef5eea0d8b9ff0b3eca86ae413d6cdde114a9930","dweb:/ipfs/QmdBE8T1BTddZxpdECMsb3KiCFyjNWmxcCddYrWFTXmWPj"]},"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/utils/ContextUpgradeable.sol":{"keccak256":"0xdbef5f0c787055227243a7318ef74c8a5a1108ca3a07f2b3a00ef67769e1e397","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://08e39f23d5b4692f9a40803e53a8156b72b4c1f9902a88cd65ba964db103dab9","dweb:/ipfs/QmPKn6EYDg